WEBVTT

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.020
W-Welcome!

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:10.780
Thank you.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:17.050
<i>That's the detective who interrogated 
Kyohei-kun and Hibino.</i>

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.490
Have you decided what...

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.590
A blend.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.130
Are you sure this is all right?

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:00.660
Is it wrong for a detective to drink at a cafe?

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.220
No...

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:04.720
H-Here you go.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:09.980
Helping out your family?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:11.510
Good for you.

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:12.700
N-N-No...

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.740
It's September. Shouldn't you be in school?

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:22.590
I'm taking off from school 
due to family circumstances.

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:24.070
The school gave permission.

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.790
Even though it's your compulsory education?

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:29.040
That's unusual.

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.540
Did you have some special reason?

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.550
Oh, right!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.550
Do you know about that thing with the dolls?

00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:42.070
I only saw it on TV...

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:44.050
Pretty amazing, right?

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:46.850
Isn't it the kind of thing that interests kids?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.980
I-I only saw it on TV...

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:53.020
Actually, we were there.

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:57.030
I'm pretty sure I saw you 
and your brother there, too.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.400
Am I mistaken?

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:03.780
Utao-chan, stop slacking off 
and get back to the counter.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.930
R-Right!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:11.880
That wasn't very nice,

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.170
bullying a little girl that way.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.890
It doesn't matter.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:20.760
The important thing is that now I'm convinced

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.320
that this case has legs.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.460
You're really sure?

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.720
How will you explain that to the chief?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.020
Hell if I know.

00:03:29.460 --> 00:03:30.790
Stupid!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.190
Never come back!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.150
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.150
<b>Tangled Relations</b>

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:38.990
Hey, Kyohei-kun.

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:41.210
Good to see you.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.780
How's it going?

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:43.960
How's what going?

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:49.700
Didn't you spend summer vacation 
under the same roof as your beloved?

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:52.190
If nothing happened,

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.230
I don't know if you can call yourself a man.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.170
Good to know.

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.040
Hey! Wait up!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.710
Nothing honestly happened?

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:01.540
Sure.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.090
What's wrong with you?

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:05.800
Then be sure to get it done tomorrow!

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:09.390
Tomorrow? What's he talking about?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.520
So, about the party tomorrow...

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:17.430
Hibino-chan?

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:19.150
Getting a message from the mother ship?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:23.780
Actually, I was looking for Kuuko.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.870
Karahari?

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.730
Have you seen her?

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:30.000
You're the only one who's friends with that loon.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:36.540
<i>I've been so busy, I forgot to talk to her.</i>

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:40.050
<i>Come to think of it, I haven't seen her since then.</i>

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:43.550
<i>I wonder what she's up to.</i>

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:47.390
I've got it! I've got it!

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:51.200
The stuff the weekly magazines 
should love keeps coming.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.810
So you even use your own parents, 
all for your hobbies?

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:03.740
Kyosuke's the dumbass who 
wrote down the police database password!

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.730
Old people are idiots.

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:08.240
They don't trust anything that isn't written down.

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:12.400
If you'd just tell me who you are,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.980
I wouldn't have to do this.

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.120
Not my problem.

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.080
I'm letting you stay 
here for free, and feeding you.

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:20.600
How can you talk to me that way?

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.500
Never asked you to do that.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.760
Like you have anywhere to go.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.510
You never shut up, bitch.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:31.260
You're a dick, you know that?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.270
<b>Bank</b>

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.270
<b>Here</b>

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.270
<b>Station 
South Exit</b>

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.270
<b>Flower Shop</b>

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:36.140
Then this is it?

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:39.450
Welcome!

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:41.750
Hey, Uta-bou.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:42.900
How ya doing?

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.980
Moyako?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.160
I brought tea.

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.250
How thoughtful of you.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.640
You surprised me,

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:55.620
just showing up.

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.760
I have something to do, here in Tokyo.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.750
I just stopped by to give Kukuri a checkup.

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:04.170
Hey, I was also...

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.240
...wondering about this when 
I repaired it at the village.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.930
Did you use Kukuri's left hand?

00:06:08.930 --> 00:06:10.480
Um...

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:14.000
This round part comes out, and it goes "bang-bang."

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.310
I think so, yeah...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.320
You think so?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.100
You think so?

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:22.400
I wasn't even thinking about it, 
so I'm not sure if I did it.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.790
I see.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.730
So that's what happened to Takemikazuchi...

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.110
That's amazing.

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:33.300
From what Grandfather's said,

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:37.120
Kyohei was the only one, in the last few centuries, 
who could open its left arm.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.590
Really?

00:06:38.590 --> 00:06:41.470
I guess you actually are siblings...

00:06:41.470 --> 00:06:46.060
To be honest, I wasn't sure 
you'd be any good at this.

00:06:46.060 --> 00:06:47.630
You weren't?

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.400
Don't worry about it.

00:06:49.400 --> 00:06:51.580
You're as good as anyone now.

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:55.760
At least, in terms of making tea.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.100
But doesn't that mean Kyohei was really good?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.470
I don't know about that...

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.400
Is that you, Moyako-san?

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.030
Welcome back.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.080
Moyako?

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:11.660
Koushiro brought you?

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.890
Yeah. He made me come along.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:16.300
Why?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:22.700
I'd just finished the majority of Takemikazuchi's work.

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:25.670
But Koushiro wanted it back immediately.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:27.840
I'm an Utsuwashi.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.920
I told him I couldn't hand it over 
unless it was perfect.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:34.800
And he told you to accompany him to Tokyo 
and finish the work here?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.850
"I'll pay your expenses," he said.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.420
Who does he think he is, anyway?

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:43.060
I'm surprised that you agreed.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.020
Well, I didn't have a choice...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:55.240
No one would want to leave a kid 
around that crazy old man Hyuga...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.120
Is Kirio doing well?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.000
That's right... He had a message for you.

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:07.930
What is it?

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.280
"Dummy!"

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:11.940
Now, now...

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.300
Oh, yeah.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:15.550
Here.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:17.100
I forgot.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.090
Yurako said to give you this.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:26.960
I have a request for you, Hibino.

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:27.650
For me?

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.020
If there's anything I can do...

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:33.470
Well, I've come all this way to Tokyo,

00:08:33.470 --> 00:08:35.500
so could you show me around?

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:38.520
Maybe Shibuya or Harajuku?

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.190
"Put this near your pillow when you sleep."

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.260
I'd love to.

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:43.400
"I'll be sleeping with a doll of you, Utao-sama."

00:08:41.260 --> 00:08:42.500
Really?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.390
When would be good?

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:45.290
Whenever's good for you!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.190
You've got school, right?

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:49.280
Tell me what day works for you.

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:51.530
What?

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.550
I was just thinking that you really are a girl,

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.430
interested in that stuff...

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.930
Stupid Kyohei.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.260
Your sushi's here.

00:09:02.780 --> 00:09:03.310
Huh?

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:04.500
What's wrong?

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:11.270
Thanks for dinner!

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.360
You're welcome.

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.040
Thanks for today.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.130
I had a good time.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:16.940
Come back.

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:18.700
I'll see you to the station.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:19.740
Thanks.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.230
Me too...

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.230
Utao-chan!

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:26.370
Help me clean up, okay?

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:34.360
You really can't see the stars...

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:37.840
If you're lucky, you can see 
up to magnitude 2 stars.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.740
That doesn't count.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.110
Well? How's it going?

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.030
Looking for Aki!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:45.930
Making any progress?

00:09:47.260 --> 00:09:49.050
Come on!

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.840
This is everyone's goal,

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:51.940
Koushiro and Uta-bou's, too.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.340
Yeah, come to think of it...

00:09:56.470 --> 00:10:00.070
I heard we had a near miss, 
right after we returned, but...

00:10:00.440 --> 00:10:01.430
Heard?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:03.420
Utao and Hibino-san ran into him.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:05.000
I wasn't there.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:06.770
And?

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:10.710
He said the kakashi were only 
for murder and destruction.

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.680
I see.

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.150
Hey.

00:10:16.940 --> 00:10:18.760
About Kirio...

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.790
You two didn't know about him, did you?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.780
No, it's strange,

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:27.390
being informed that you have a brother.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.390
Concerned?

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.410
A little.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:34.810
Kyohei's late.

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.230
I'm sure they have a lot to discuss.

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.020
Suspicious...

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.020
Doesn't it bother you, Hibino?

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:42.870
Why would it?

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:47.410
<i>Awesome! One less rival.</i>

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:52.530
They're probably talking about Kirio-kun.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:55.400
If he's your little brother,

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:57.430
then he's also Kuga-kun's brother, right?

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:00.450
Oh, I see.

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:03.660
That's why you let them walk back together?

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:09.560
I don't think I'll be able to get Kirio back soon.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:13.690
But it isn't bad for him to be staying with Koushiro.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.700
Yeah, I suppose.

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.140
Tell him to take care of himself.

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.280
The air here is bad and dry...

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:23.780
So your throat gets sore really easily.

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.520
You're such a nice older brother!

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.040
Shut up.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.000
Karakami Village...

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:55.550
I'd have to go there to investigate further.

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:59.320
Why don't you want to return?

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:06.780
Or can you not?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:08.790
Not your business.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:13.760
Six years ago, a lot of people were 
pronounced dead on the same day.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:15.340
Supposedly, it was a mudslide.

00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:18.740
But there's no news record of any mudslide.

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:19.900
And that's not all.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.240
Your village is all kinds of suspicious...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.410
And?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.870
You're pretty weird, you know that?

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.100
How so?

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:32.310
A babe's sitting on top of you like this,

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.020
rubbing herself against you,

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.110
and you show no reaction.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:38.980
You're useless.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:41.240
And we've been living together for a while, too.

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:45.490
You're a mass murderer, aren't you?

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.370
A threat to society, right?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.900
You should do something big!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:55.140
Something really big... Flashy! Huge!

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.880
Something that will change the world!

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:02.550
Okay.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.430
If that's how you want to play...

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:09.930
Dad?!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.920
Your dad?

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.390
You must be close.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.580
Don't be stupid.

00:13:16.980 --> 00:13:17.780
Here!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.190
Take your shoes, and hide somewhere.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.340
What is it?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.800
I came to check on you.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:26.990
I hadn't heard from you in a bit.

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:30.070
Now you've checked up on me, right?

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:31.500
I'm busy!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:32.760
Right, right.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.900
What? Hey!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.960
What? What is it?

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:40.070
Are you going to school?

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.130
I am.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.380
Stop snooping in a young woman's room!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.540
What's going on, anyway?

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:53.030
I smelled something.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:54.390
Are you a dog?!

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:55.690
A wolf.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:58.150
<i>That wasn't funny...</i>

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:01.820
Make sure you go to school.

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.730
Sure.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.290
God...

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.520
It's fine now!

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:07.800
You can come out.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:10.370
Aki?

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:12.870
He took off?

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:23.700
Not bad, I guess.

00:14:30.310 --> 00:14:31.710
Let's eat.

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.470
Yeah.

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:47.340
I didn't expect you to call.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.270
Where'd you get the number?

00:14:50.270 --> 00:14:51.350
Moyako.

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.410
Ah.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:54.200
So, what's up?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:57.520
Who wouldn't be worried about 
their younger brother?

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.030
Worried?

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:01.210
With him around that old geezer.

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.110
Yeah.

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:06.440
That's why I brought him with me, as my partner.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:09.390
As long as he's with me,

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:11.190
I'll make sure nothing gets out of hand.

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:14.270
After all, he's also Takemikazuchi's Seki.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:18.100
Don't worry about him.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.850
What's your job here?

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:23.180
You know I can't tell you.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.230
What is Hyuga planning?

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:28.360
Who knows?

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:31.610
So you didn't release Aki?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.740
What's going to happen now?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.620
The girl with the rack... She your girlfriend?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.130
Sadly...

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.620
Don't change the subject!

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:48.130
God's in his heaven. All's right with the world.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.480
But our gods are down here, with us.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:54.930
So nothing's ever right.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:59.000
You should decide if you're going 
to open your eyes or not.

00:16:00.940 --> 00:16:04.030
If you don't decide, 
you won't just be getting yourself killed.

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:06.940
You'll involve a lot of other people.

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.570
Oh, right.

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:13.320
Kirio wanted to see Utao.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.080
<i>If I don't decide, I'll get myself killed, huh?</i>

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:23.580
<i>What do I want to do, now that I've left the village?</i>

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.340
<i>What did I want to do?</i>

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.590
<i>What did I gain by leaving?</i>

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:50.230
<i>If I can't escape, I need to think...</i>

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:55.490
<i>What can I do, given everything that's going on?</i>

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.990
<i>What do I need to do?</i>

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:02.860
Oh, Kuga-kun.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.140
I got a message from my dad.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:09.060
He was wondering when I'll be home.

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:09.880
I see.

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.850
<i>It's been six months since that day...</i>

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.010
<i>The day of the department party.</i>

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:20.030
<i>Utao and Aki arrived, 
and I went to live with Hibino-san.</i>

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:22.650
<i>This is just like it was back then.</i>

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:25.230
Not feeling well?

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:25.890
Drunk?

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.820
Not at all.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.000
Hey, Hibino-san.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:33.530
Um...

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.330
Um...

00:17:36.330 --> 00:17:36.950
I—

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.700
What are you two doing out here?

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:43.540
It's suspicious! Suspicious!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.860
No, it isn't!

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:45.930
You're got the wrong idea!

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:50.480
<i>Having come here, have I been able to change?</i>

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:53.230
Hey, Ryan!

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.540
Don't run!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:58.260
<i>Here I am, far away, just like you wanted.</i>

00:17:58.260 --> 00:17:59.890
<i>Happy now?</i>

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.170
I'm such a failure...

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:08.980
I did have some fun at first.

00:18:10.170 --> 00:18:12.570
But I can't fool myself.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.370
I'll have to blast that hellhole

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:17.570
off the face of the Earth

00:18:18.020 --> 00:18:19.910
before I'll be able to change.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.020
There's nowhere for me to go.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.450
And even if there were, there'd be no point...

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:28.470
Do you understand, Chihaya?

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.080
Nono?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.220
Yo.

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:43.240
Hey, got a sec?

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.400
Koushiro

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:56.890
So cute.

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:58.670
You look like a big sister.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.860
Y-Yeah?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:05.000
Kuga-kun set things up so you could see Kirio.

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.320
You want everything to be perfect.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.410
Kyohei!

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.420
So cute!

00:19:11.910 --> 00:19:14.920
This was you at your elementary school graduation?!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.880
You already looked so grown up...

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:23.230
That's your type?

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:24.890
Sure is!

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.060
I'm going to take photos, too!

00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:29.560
That's a great idea!

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.520
Smile.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:39.780
You never did learn to smile normally.

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:43.780
I-I'm not good at smiling...

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:44.800
Hey!

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.200
Don't worry about it.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:47.970
But...

00:19:48.490 --> 00:19:51.210
Once you see Kirio-kun, you'll smile naturally.

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:53.140
Really?

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:54.720
I'll take one more.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:03.140
Now then, let's get down to business.

00:20:03.440 --> 00:20:08.030
Kirio, this is between you and your big sister there.

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.880
The Hyuga and Kuga aren't friends.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.790
Honestly, they're enemies.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:17.790
But that's only under the surface.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:20.150
He's pretty blunt...

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:23.340
We can't pick fights every time we meet.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:26.370
I-I didn't want to fight, either!

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:29.300
You let him provoke you, 
and you rampaged with your kakashi.

00:20:29.300 --> 00:20:30.120
It's the same thing.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.540
Our mission here is to catch Aki.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:38.300
Whatever's going on between you doesn't concern us.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:41.360
So.

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:43.520
Kirio...

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.930
You're a man, right?

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:49.590
You wouldn't go back on a promise

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:52.100
made in front of others, would you?

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:57.520
We don't want to fight.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:59.430
We have no reason to.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:01.070
Would you promise us?

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:09.410
I won't pick fights with Utao anymore...

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.790
Good.

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:14.020
All right.

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.870
Now make sure you keep your promise.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:22.150
Are you sure about this?

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:26.870
Being nice to the Kuga behind the master's back.

00:21:26.870 --> 00:21:27.800
<i>That voice...</i>

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.310
I guess when you're the next head of the clan,

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:33.060
you get extra privileges.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:35.710
That's not fair, Ko-chan.

00:21:35.710 --> 00:21:38.600
I've had to be a good girl for such a long time...

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:39.440
Where are you?

00:21:40.160 --> 00:21:41.400
Come out, Mahiru!

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:04.400
I've missed you, Kyohei-sama.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:46.070
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:46.070
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:38.160
Once again, it's time for Kamisama Dolls Corner.

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:40.020
What you've all been awaiting, the Hibino special!

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>This is 
Hibino!!</b>

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.000
<b>I'm not 
jealous.</b>

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:41.670
She's cute. They're big.

00:23:41.670 --> 00:23:43.560
I won't say what "they" are, but they're big.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:44.830
Don't be happy, Kukuri.

00:23:45.800 --> 00:23:46.070
Alright!

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:47.940
Next time: The Princess Arrives.

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:49.990
<b>Next Episode: 
The Princess Arrives</b>

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:49.650
I'll bite you if you don't watch! Chomp!

